c ******************* 786 **************************** c

Ref: "Electron-Ion Recombination Rate Coefficients, Photoionization Cross
    Sections, and Ionization Fractions for Astrophysically Abundant Elements
    I. Carbon and Nitrogen", Sultana N. Nahar and Anil K. Pradhan,
    Astrophys. J. Suppl. 111, 339 (1997)

NOTE: Present results do not include radiation damping of low energy
resonances. However, the damping was found important in the relativistic
calculations. Hence the FS-file is recommended.

